# AI provider configuration (optional)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# HerHealth Timeline talks to any OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions API
# (model, messages in -> choices[0].message.content out). Copy this file
# to .env.local and fill in real values to enable live AI suggestions.
#
# .env.local is gitignored and is only ever read on the server side
# (inside vite.config.js / server/groq.js) — never shipped to the browser.
#
# If these are left blank (or a live request fails for any reason), the
# app automatically falls back to a clearly labeled local simulation, so
# it always works end to end either way.
#
# NOTE: GitHub Models' inference API was fully retired on 2026-07-30 and
# can no longer be used. The example below uses Groq's OpenAI-compatible
# API (console.groq.com), which currently hosts OpenAI's open-weight
# "openai/gpt-oss-20b" / "openai/gpt-oss-120b" models. Any other
# OpenAI-compatible provider works too — just change the URL/key/model.

AI_API_KEY=your_key_here
AI_API_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
AI_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
